  "tag_name": "v1.0.13",
  "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:44:51Z",
  "body": "- Added Transition intro type\r\n- Added custom room colour to room attributes\r\n- Added room-wide fill mode to bucket tool\r\n- Added command line options to load only specific mods or no mods on launch\r\n- Changed strawberry pips display to a line to show their animation order\r\n- Styleground window is now completely empty in a map without stylegrounds until a styleground is added\r\n- Fixed Alt Music Trigger track selector showing unusable options\r\n- Fixed text on styleground dropdown in styleground window\r\n- Fixed dropdowns closing when using the scrollbar\r\n- Fixed crash when using custom language\r\n- Fixed oddities when placing entities with nodes\r\n- Fixed issue when saving over a vanilla map\r\n\r\n\r\nFor developers:\r\n\r\n- Added `nodeInitialCount` to entity and trigger plugins to determine the initial number of nodes on placement",
